{
  "description": "Shared fixtures for compat-rules.json (schema/compat-rules.schema.json). The C++ core (native/core/src/compat_rules.cpp, run by native/core/tests/test-compat.sh) and the launcher's Rust reader (crates/kiln-manage/src/compat.rs) must give the same results. glob: a module matcher against a DLL file name. parse: one file's text (`input`: a string is the raw file text, anything else is the JSON) -> `ok` (false: the whole file is ignored), the ids of the rules that stay, in order, and `dropped` (how many rules did not validate; the reasons are informative). merge: the shipped file's rules and the player's file's rules -> the final rule ids in order. evaluate: rules (already validated) against the facts of one start -> the ids of the rules that fire, in order. facts: modules = DLL file names present, engines = engine words present, mods = `<engine>:<id>` of the enabled profile mods, symbols = sigdb symbols with an overlap.",
  "glob": [
    {
      "pattern": "xhl-core.dll",
      "name": "xhl-core.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "xhl-core.dll",
      "name": "XHL-Core.DLL",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "XHL*.dll",
      "name": "xhl-core.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "xhl*.dll",
      "name": "xhl.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "*.dll",
      "name": "anything.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "*",
      "name": "x",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "x*l*.dll",
      "name": "xhl-core-all.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "xhl*.dll",
      "name": "my-xhl.dll",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "xhl",
      "name": "xhl.dll",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "xhl.dll",
      "name": "xhl.dll.bak",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "a*b*c",
      "name": "abc",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "a*b*c",
      "name": "acb",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "a?c.dll",
      "name": "abc.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "a?c.dll",
      "name": "ac.dll",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "a?c.dll",
      "name": "a?c.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "??.dll",
      "name": "ab.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "??.dll",
      "name": "abc.dll",
      "match": false
    },
    {
      "pattern": "xhl-*.dll",
      "name": "xhl-.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "ü*.dll",
      "name": "Ü-mod.dll",
      "match": true
    },
    {
      "pattern": "*.dll",
      "name": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa.dll",
      "match": false
    }
  ],
